                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطِيَّةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A camel:</i> (Msb:) <i>a camel,</i> or <i>beast,
that one rides; a beast that goes with energy and</i>
                        
                        <i>speed:</i> (K:) or <i>a she-camel,</i> or <i>he-camel, that is
used for riding;</i> (TA;) [and so <i>a horse,</i> &amp;c.;]
<i>a saddle-camel,</i> or <i>camel that one rides.</i> (KL.)
